reviews.feedback:
1. This test case is not correct "Unchanged price proceeds cleanly". We do rewrite package, but we don't show the new price to the passenger. The customer shoud pay the prive agreed at search. If we charge a different price, this is overcharge/undercharge. 
2. This one is wrong "Unavailable fare blocks the booking".  When we get Flight no longer available error in check availability, we still go further and hope that the optimizer will find other candidates. We should not try the original contestant though. 
3 change the format of Mongo queries. It should be runable in mongodb compas 

Example of the forrmat we need
[
  { $match: {
      context: { $regex: "^Onefly::check-availability", $options: "i" },
      date_added: { $gt: new Date(Date.now() - 6*3600*1000) }
  } },
  { $group: { _id: "$context", c: { $sum: 1 } } },
  { $sort: { c: -1 } }
]
